@page "/"

<PageTitle>Director Of Rugby</PageTitle>

<section class="hero">
    <h1>A Rugby Union management sim, in the browser.</h1>
    <p class="lede">
        Manage a club through a career: tactics, transfers, scouting, coaches, set plays,
        training, finances, and promotion/relegation across seasons. All running
        <b>entirely client-side</b> — no server, the simulation runs here.
    </p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/career">🏉 Play career mode</a>
        <a class="btn" href="match">▶ Quick match</a>
        <a class="btn" href="table">▦ Quick season</a>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="cards">
    <div class="card">
        <h3>Deterministic</h3>
        <p>Every match and season is seeded — the same seed reproduces the exact same result, here or on the desktop.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
        <h3>Reused, not rewritten</h3>
        <p>The whole simulation — match engine, competitions, transfers, training, finances — is shared C#. Zero simulation logic lives in this UI.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
        <h3>Saved in your browser</h3>
        <p>Careers persist to localStorage — close the tab and pick up where you left off.</p>
    </div>
</section>
